      "title": "Tips",
      "lines": [
        "Feed drums with low",
        " onset threshold:",
        " each hit excites",
        " the bank like a",
        " tuned ringing tail.",
        "",
        "Vocal input with",
        " high Resonators and",
        " long Decay: harmonic",
        " stretching, voices",
        " smear into chords.",
        "",
        "Pair Arp Sync with",
        " host transport for",
        " rhythmic shimmer",
        " on sustained sounds.",
        "",
        "Scale = Free skips",
        " quantization (free",
